Transparent Top Bar (Auto)
https://github.com/spencercnorton/transparent-top-bar

This is a fork of Transparent Top Bar by Paul Fauchon and contributors
(https://github.com/lamarios/gnome-shell-extension-transparent-top-bar),
itself a fork of Hai Zhang's extension
(https://github.com/zhanghai/gnome-shell-extension-transparent-top-bar), which
turned the transparent top bar that GNOME Shell 3.32 removed back into an
extension. It is based on upstream commit
74b3ae8576c6f1354218d2f9d6a8d595f6097c7a, whose history it keeps unchanged.

